      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Biomarker Exploration\nreads: tiles + assembled matrix + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Correlation per band centre, one row per contact pair\n2.  Discrimination (area under curve) per band centre\n3.  Band centre x integration-time sweep, 22 x 10 grid\n4.  Data-availability timeline per channel\n\nCACHED  cold 42.83 s -> 6.06 s with the file present",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "mo0",
      "originalText": "Biomarker Exploration\nreads: tiles + assembled matrix + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Correlation per band centre, one row per contact pair\n2.  Discrimination (area under curve) per band centre\n3.  Band centre x integration-time sweep, 22 x 10 grid\n4.  Data-availability timeline per channel\n\nCACHED  cold 42.83 s -> 6.06 s with the file present",
      "autoResize": false,
