      "locked": false,
      "text": "Closed-Loop Deployment\nreads: evidence inputs (from the tile cache) + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Deployability verdict, 6 of 50 settings\n2.  Evidence triangle: current -> power -> pain\n3.  Three-source comparison of how current moves power\n4.  Prescription, duty cycle and device rule ledger\n\nCACHED  evidence inputs keyed on the recording set",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "mo2",
      "originalText": "Closed-Loop Deployment\nreads: evidence inputs (from the tile cache) + REDCap\n\nOutputs\n1.  Deployability verdict, 6 of 50 settings\n2.  Evidence triangle: current -> power -> pain\n3.  Three-source comparison of how current moves power\n4.  Prescription, duty cycle and device rule ledger\n\nCACHED  evidence inputs keyed on the recording set",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
